---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/layout/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/layout/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — Focus Pet"
  description="The terms for downloading and using Focus Pet."
>
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-16">
      <a href="/" class="font-heading font-semibold text-text-secondary no-underline hover:text-accent-blue">
        &larr; Back to Home
      </a>

      <div class="mt-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold md:text-4xl">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-text-secondary">Last updated July 23, 2026.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-8 text-text-secondary">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Using Focus Pet</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Focus Pet is a desktop focus companion for Windows. The core app — the focus timer, website and
            application blocking, and decorating your space — is free to use for as long as you like. By downloading
            or using Focus Pet, you agree to these terms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Application Detection</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Focus Pet monitors which applications are running on your computer in order to provide its core
            focus-tracking features.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            When you choose one or more applications to focus on, Focus Pet checks the list of currently running
            applications to determine whether your selected application is open and being used for a focus session.
            This allows the app to:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>Detect when a focus session starts and ends.</li>
            <li>Track the time you spend focusing.</li>
            <li>Award in-game progress, achievements, and rewards.</li>
            <li>Display focus statistics and history.</li>
            <li>Synchronize your progress across devices if you choose to create an account.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Focus Pet only identifies running applications that are necessary for these features.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">Focus Pet does not:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>Read the contents of your files or documents.</li>
            <li>Record your keyboard or mouse activity.</li>
            <li>Capture screenshots or record your screen.</li>
            <li>Read the content of websites or applications.</li>
            <li>Access personal information stored within other applications.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Application detection only occurs while Focus Pet is running and is used solely to provide the features
            described above.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Accounts and Cloud Saves</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Creating a Focus Pet account is optional — Guest Mode gives you the full experience with your progress
            saved locally on your device. If you choose to create an account, we store information such as your
            email address, game progress, achievements, settings, and other gameplay-related data so that your
            progress can be synchronized across supported devices.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials and for any activity
            that occurs under your account.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Focus Pro</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Focus Pro is an optional paid upgrade. Purchase and billing details are shown at the time you choose to
            buy it. Nothing about the free experience changes if you don't purchase Focus Pro.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">Focus Pet relies on trusted third-party services to provide certain functionality, including:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li><span class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Supabase</span> — user authentication and cloud save synchronization.</li>
            <li><span class="font-semibold text-text-primary">RevenueCat</span> — subscription and purchase management (where applicable).</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">These services are governed by their own Terms of Service and Privacy Policies.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">App Availability</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            We continually improve Focus Pet and may release updates, add features, modify existing functionality,
            or discontinue features at any time.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We strive to keep the application working across supported operating systems, but we cannot guarantee
            compatibility with every hardware or software configuration.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Acceptable Use</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">You agree not to:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>Attempt to reverse engineer, decompile, or modify the application except where permitted by law.</li>
            <li>Circumvent or interfere with Focus Pet's intended functionality.</li>
            <li>Use the application in a manner that could damage, disable, or impair the service.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Changes to these terms</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            We may update these terms as Focus Pet changes. If we do, we'll update the date at the top of this page.
            Continuing to use Focus Pet after an update means you accept the revised terms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Questions</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            If you have questions about these terms, contact us at
            <a href="mailto:help@tryfocuspet.com">help@tryfocuspet.com</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
